  "bodyHash": "RrAUfGtwmFI=",
  "content": "<p>这个为机械动力（Create）制作的附属模组添加了传动链！它是一个有用的方块，用于在传送带之间传递旋转动力。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354280/description_e8fd8f30-3abc-40f5-99ec-cc3884095006.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354280/description_073bf77b-1aa3-4fa9-af01-48c696c6f994.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>它可以用来连接成直角、连续排列，甚至上下堆叠的传送带！</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1354280/description_206dec95-bb0f-4902-9a1c-8c04cde6ea5d.gif\" alt=\"\"></p><p>设计初衷是为了简化传送带的动力传输，避免使用齿轮箱和封闭式链条传动装置的笨重布局，同时不会让这些设备被淘汰！实际上，传动链只能放置在传送带上……但如果你希望不受限制地放置它们，配置选项中提供了相应的设置！</p><p>以下是一些改进示例：</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_053a5d14-0bd6-423e-b8fc-e3c432a95728.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3cbaa15c-ea47-47aa-b758-cb92db420d87.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8db55b6b-a83f-4e1d-a426-d35e11b7700e.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_67faabc5-d517-48e4-ab15-ff9f010b834d.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_ccc25b24-e4ba-4940-b53f-6ee19fa6566f.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>传动链也可以像传送带一样被封闭包裹！</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_971272f1-3035-4e10-a15e-9c7fd0fe1805.png\" alt=\"\"><br>\n希望大家喜欢我的模组！玩得开心！</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1e8c87e3-831e-4187-9374-59ac8179c0c6.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>",
